I'm considering ways of making the agent loop more customizable, using a DSL.

Here's kind of what the current agent loop looks like I think

```
(def-agent (dialog model tools buffer)
  (set completed nil)
  (while (not completed)
    (set response (run dialog model tools buffer :stream true))
    (set tool-calls (get response 'tool-calls))
    (if tool-calls
        (progn
          (tool-responses (map 'execute-tool tool-calls :buffer buffer :stream true))
          (set dialog (append dialog tool-responses)))
      (set completed t))))
```

