- `generate` - makes LLM call, returns parsed response, handles all streaming/rendering
- `execute-tools` - runs tools in parallel, handles streaming output, blocks until complete
- `finish` - exits loop, adds final USER tag
- `iteration`, `dialog`, `buffer` - implicitly available context
- All UI updates happen automatically based on response streaming

